  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the lamb mince and cook, breaking it up with a spoon, until browned, 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add the onion, ginger, and garlic and cook, stirring occasionally, for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the cumin, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chickpeas, Chinese leaf, pomegranate molasses, mustard seeds, and coriander.",
    "Stir well to combine, then reduce heat to low and simmer, uncovered, for 10-15 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Meanwhile, toast the mustard seeds in a small pan over medium heat, stirring frequently, until fragrant, 2-3 minutes.",
    "Chop the chickpea mixture into small pieces and divide among ssam-wraps or wraps.",
    "Sprinkle with toasted mustard seeds, chopped parsley, and a dollop of yogurt, if desired.",
    "Serve warm and crispy, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
